## 🧪 Practical Learning

Computer College me learning sirf theory aur MCQ par based nahi hogi.

Player ko practical tasks bhi milenge.

Examples:

- Code likhna
- Existing code samajhna
- Error find karna
- Small programs banana
- Website components banana
- Projects complete karna
- Debugging practice

Difficulty player ke skill level ke according change hogi.

## 🏆 Projects & Practice

Player apni learning ke baad practical projects bana sakega.

Project difficulty:

Beginner
↓
Elementary
↓
Intermediate
↓
Advanced
