## 📈 Student Progression

Student ka progression sirf exam marks par depend nahi karega.

Progression me multiple factors consider kiye ja sakte hain:

- 📚 Academic Performance
- 🧪 Practical Performance
- 🛠️ Projects
- 🎯 Skills
- 📊 Test Results
- 👨‍🏫 Teacher Evaluation
- 🏆 Achievements
- 💼 Career Requirements

## 🧠 Skill-Based Progression

Student ke academic result ke saath uski actual skills bhi track ki ja sakengi.

Example:

Student ke paas high marks ho sakte hain, lekin kisi practical skill me weakness ho sakti hai.

System us weakness ko identify karke:

- Extra Practice
- Additional Lessons
- Teacher Guidance
- Practical Tasks

recommend kar sakta hai.

